# Safety and ask-first

## Don't touch

- `.env.local` — never read or write. Tell the user what env vars to change.
- Committed `server/db/drizzle/*.sql` migrations — generate new ones instead.
- `package-lock.json` — let `npm install` manage it.

## Ask before

- `db:push` / schema changes against live Neon (especially `main`)
- Deleting or truncating user/auth tables
- Rotating secrets
- `git push`, force-push, branch deletion
- Installing new top-level dependencies

Full constitution: see `AGENTS.md`.
